{"_id":"6a2ff5d92204ffbc59e5a67f","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"oXhGEIie-MzfUSM2Ng4Zm","description":"# re\n\nThe `re` module provides regular expression support for pattern matching and text manipulation. It is used for extracting structured data from unstructured text, validating formats, and performing complex find-and-replace operations. Key functions include `re.match()`, `re.search()`, `re.findall()`, and `re.sub()`.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"re ΓÇö Regular expression operations","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaed"},{"type":"official","title":"Regular expression HOWTO","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/howto/regex.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaee"},{"type":"article","title":"Python RegEx","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_regex.asp","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaef"},{"type":"video","title":"Python Tutorial: re Module - How to Write and Match Regular Expressions (Regex)","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K8L6KVGG-7o","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeaf0"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:53:45.491Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/oXhGEIie-MzfUSM2Ng4Zm.md"}